# --- reference/ : CURATED ALLOWLIST -----------------------------------------------------
# reference/ holds the full research record: ~650 files of probes, campaign scripts, run
# configs, session notes and reports accumulated from June to August 2026. All of it stays
# ON DISK and all of it is still in git history at commit cf1d8f1 -- nothing is lost. But
# shipping 650 files makes the interesting ones unfindable, so the repo tracks an explicit
# allowlist: the documents that carry the story and the method, the instruments that are
# reusable, and the measured numbers. reference/README.md is the index.
#
# To put a file back under version control, add a `!` line for it here.
reference/**
!reference/**/

!reference/README.md
!reference/UPSTREAM_README.md
!reference/REBUILD_2026-09-09.md
!reference/RESEARCH_STATUS.md
